# Generated rollback scripts for one-off migrations that have already run.
# They contain absolute paths from the machine that produced them, and the
# archive has been rewritten since, so they cannot be safely replayed.
*-undo*.sh
.devon-index-dirty
.oss-harvest-state.json
logs/
migrate-to-claude-cli.sh

# Triage reports. `oss backlog` regenerates these, and the hub re-sweeps any
# report older than a day, so committing them means a new file every morning.
# They are read from disk by name, never by git, and a stale one is worthless —
# the sweep that produced it is the artefact, not the HTML.
triage-*.html
